@StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

### Auth - Register User
POST {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Test Student"
}

### Auth - Login User
# @name login
POST {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Auth Token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Jobs - Get All Jobs
GET {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Accept: application/json

### Jobs - Search Jobs by Query
GET {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?q=developer
Accept: application/json

### Jobs - Create New Job
POST {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blazor Developer Needed",
  "description": "Looking for a student to help build UI components.",
  "category": "Programming",
  "budget": 350.00,
  "deadline": "2026-10-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### Jobs - Get Job By ID
GET {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/1
Accept: application/json

### Users - Get Current User Profile
GET {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Services - Get Offered Services
GET {{StudentJobHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services
Accept: application/json